<title>BELGIUM: EU extends probe into Vulkan use of subsidies.</title>
<headline>EU extends probe into Vulkan use of subsidies.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission is expected to announce on Wednesday it is extending a probe into the alleged misuse by Bremer Vulkan AG of another 200 million marks ($132.5 million) in German subsidies, European Union sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>($ = 1.51 German Marks)</p>
